MintCurveConvexPosition::transferOwnership(address)
├── given caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is the owner
    ├── when newOwner is a non-zero address
    │   ├── it should set pendingOwner to newOwner
    │   ├── it should leave the current owner unchanged until acceptance
    │   ├── it should keep the current owner's authorizations effective
    │   └── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted
    └── when a pending transfer already exists
        └── when newOwner is the zero address
            └── it should clear the pending transfer
